s","year":"2019"},{"page":5,"title":"Girl laughing","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":6,"title":"Two children swinging on a gate","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"Laughing girl","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl laughing and pointing at something","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl in shock","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"Series of activities","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Girl working at her table","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"Boy and girl reading","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":13,"title":"A girl and a man in a lab","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":14,"title":"Man putting on a coat","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":15,"title":"Girl looking at a poster","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":16,"title":"Two men laughing at a primitive looking vehicle","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":17,"title":"Group of laughing animals","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":18,"title":"Man and little girl reading a book","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":19,"title":"different kinds of laughter backdrop","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":20,"title":"Man carrying a girl piggyback","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":21,"title":"Man and a girl talking about food","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":22,"title":"Girl wiggling with laughter","illustrator":"ROSH","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-15"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p01.jpg","width":479,"height":688},"text":[]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p03.jpg","width":479,"height":686},"text":[]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಉದಾಹರಣೆಗೆ, ಕಳೆದ ವಾರ ಸಹಪಾಠಿಯೊಬ್ಬ ಟಿ. ಸುಂದರಿ ಮುಂದೆ ನಗೆ ಚಟಾಕಿ ಹಾರಿಸಿದ:","ಪ್ರಶ್ನೆ: ಗಣಿತದ ಟೀಚರ್ ಯಾವಾಗಲೂ ಏಕೆ ಬೇಸರದಿಂದ ಇರುವಂತೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತಾರೆ?","ಉತ್ತರ: ಏಕೆಂದರೆ ಅವರು ಗಣಿತದ ಅನೇಕ ಲೆಕ್ಕ ಬಿಡಿಸಬೇಕಿರುವುದರಿಂದ.","ಇದನ್ನು ಕೇಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದ ಟಿ. ಸುಂದರಿ ಓರೆಕಣ್ಣು ಮಾಡಿ, ಕಿಲಕಿಲನೇ ನಕ್ಕಳು. ಅವಳಿಂದಾಗಿ ಗುಂಡಪ್ಪ ಸರ್ ಕಂಡೊಡನೆ ಇಡೀ ಕ್ಲಾಸಿಗೇ ನಗು ಉಕ್ಕಿ ಬಂತು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮರುದಿನ ಟಿ. ಸುಂದರಿ ಗ್ರಂಥಾಲಯದಲ್ಲಿದ್ದಾಗ ಪಿ.ಮಣಿಕಂಠನ್ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ಕಪಾಟಿನ ಹಿಂಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ಬಂದು ತಡೆದು ತಡೆದು ಮೆಲ್ಲಗೆ ಪುಟ್ ಪುಟ್ ಪುರ್ ರ್ ರ್ ರ್ ರ್ ರ್ ಎಂದು ಹೂಸು ಬಿಟ್ಟನು.","ಆಗ ಅಲ್ಲೇ ಹತ್ತಿರದಲ್ಲೇ ಇದ್ದ ಟಿ. ಸುಂದರಿ ಈ ಶಬ್ದ ಕೇಳಿ, ತಾನು ಪಟ್ಟಿ ಮಾಡಿದ್ದ ಸಂಗತಿ ಮರೆತು ಬಿದ್ದು ಬಿದ್ದು ನಗಲಾರಂಭಿಸಿದಳು!","ಹಾಗಾಗಿ, ಟಿ. ಸುಂದರಿಯ ಮೊದಲ ಯೋಜನೆ ಕೈಗೂಡಲಿಲ್ಲ. ಈಗ ಮತ್ತೇನಾದರೂ ಉಪಾಯ ಮಾಡಲೇಬೇಕು."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":21,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/68067-nagu-thadeyada-sundari/p21.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":92}